                  "parameters": [
                    "Credits",
                    "=",
                    "\"Huge thanks to 4ian, Bouh, Arthuro555, and all of the GDevelop \\ncommunity over the years.\\n\\n- GUI Assets -\\nHUD:  Adwitr on Itch.io / Mounir Tohami \\nTitle Font: Sanguis - Jupiter Hadley\\nGUI Font: Dogica Pixel - rmocci\\n\\n- World Art Assets -\\nMap Tileset: Ansimuz\\nPlayer Character: Ansimuz\\nMonsters: Ansimuz\\n\\n- Sound Assets -\\nMusic: Jonathan So\\nSword Sound Effect: Iwan Gabovich\\nOther Sounds: Created in GDevelop using JFXR\\n\\n- Game Design and Development - \\nSilver-Streak\\n\\n\\nPress the M key on the keyboard, the Y button on an Xbox Gamepad, or the Triangle on a Playstation Gamepad to return to the main menu.\""
                  ]
